  "decision_conditions": [
    "Insufficient information, in regarding to whether the existing windows are original/part of the historic fabric, has been submitted to demonstrate the proposed removal of the windows would not result in the loss of historic fabric. If the windows were part of the historic fabric, no justification has been submitted to support the removal of this fabric instead of repair/adaptation. As such, the proposal would be contrary to Policies HC1 of the London Plan 2021 and CS8, DM10 and DM12 of the RBK Core Strategy 2012 and the National Planning Policy Framework 2024."
  ],
